540
00:20:21,649 --> 00:20:22,636
这个是"狗杯蛋糕"
This one here is the, uh, Pupcake.

541
00:20:24,085 --> 00:20:24,607
这一款叫"电视狗"
This is the Tailavision,

542
00:20:25,371 --> 00:20:29,090
